OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 52, dies at scene of
OL,4,Amotorbike and car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a crash
OL,7,Fbetween a motorbike and a car in
OL,8,FSwansea.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police said it was called
OL,11,Fto a incident near the Glais roundabout
OL,12,Fon the A4067 at 22:40 on Friday.
OL,13,FParamedics and a Wales Air Ambulance
OL,14,Falso attended.
OL,16,FA 52-year-old man from Crook, Durham,
OL,17,Fdied at the scene. His family has been
OL,18,Finformed.
OL,20,FThe force added it is investigating the
OL,21,Fcrash and urged anyone with information
OL,22,Fand dashcam footage to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
